{"id":"39b5d097687ec105","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-rank.md","title":"Rank of a Set","display":"df-rank — Rank of a Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-rank","aliases":["58-df-rank","58-df-ranks","Ranks"],"display":"df-rank — Rank of a Set","depends_on":["[[../batch10/58-df-ordclass.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-rank"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-rank</span><span>58-df-ranks</span><span>Ranks</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-rank — Rank of a Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1d8adfba370086ed\" href=\"?note=1d8adfba370086ed\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-ordclass.md\">../batch10/58-df-ordclass.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"aabdf3005231e9dc\" href=\"?note=aabdf3005231e9dc\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md\">../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V\">\\(x\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> is the ordinal class (from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1d8adfba370086ed\" href=\"?note=1d8adfba370086ed\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-ordclass.md\">../batch10/58-df-ordclass.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\alpha\">\\(V_\\alpha\\)</span> is the cumulative hierarchy (from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"aabdf3005231e9dc\" href=\"?note=aabdf3005231e9dc\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md\">../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rank}:V\\to\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\operatorname{rank}:V\\to\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}rank}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{rank}(x)\n\\coloneqq\n\\min\\{\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}:x\\subseteq V_\\alpha\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}rank}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{rank}(x)\n\\coloneqq\n\\min\\{\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}:x\\subseteq V_\\alpha\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}rank\\text{-}recursion}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{rank}(x)\n=\\sup\\{\\operatorname{rank}(y)+1:y\\in x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}rank\\text{-}recursion}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{rank}(x)\n=\\sup\\{\\operatorname{rank}(y)+1:y\\in x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}rank\\text{-}stage}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{rank}(x)\n=\\min\\{\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}:x\\in V_{\\alpha+1}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}rank\\text{-}stage}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{rank}(x)\n=\\min\\{\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}:x\\in V_{\\alpha+1}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>These are equivalent characterizations of one rank function; the former duplicate symbol <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\">\\(\\rho\\)</span> has been removed.</li>\n<li>In particular, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rank}(\\emptyset)=0\">\\(\\operatorname{rank}(\\emptyset)=0\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rank}(\\{a\\})=\\operatorname{rank}(a)+1\">\\(\\operatorname{rank}(\\{a\\})=\\operatorname{rank}(a)+1\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch10/58-df-ordclass.md","status":"resolved","id":"1d8adfba370086ed","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-ordclass.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md","status":"resolved","id":"aabdf3005231e9dc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-ordclass.md","status":"resolved","id":"1d8adfba370086ed","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ord}$ is the ordinal class (from [[../batch10/58-df-ordclass.md]]).","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md","status":"resolved","id":"aabdf3005231e9dc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$V_\\alpha$ is the cumulative hierarchy (from [[../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"x\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"V_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{rank}:V\\to\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}rank}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{rank}(x)\n\\coloneqq\n\\min\\{\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}:x\\subseteq V_\\alpha\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}rank\\text{-}recursion}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{rank}(x)\n=\\sup\\{\\operatorname{rank}(y)+1:y\\in x\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}rank\\text{-}stage}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{rank}(x)\n=\\min\\{\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}:x\\in V_{\\alpha+1}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\rho","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{rank}(\\emptyset)=0",